@startuml
!include skin.iuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
top to bottom direction
package "Controlador local (uno por locación)" {
  [Agente de lectura\nRFID/QR] as AG
  [Monitor de sensores\nde puerta] as MS
  [Buffer local\n(store & forward)] as BUF
}
package "Servidor central SIGMA (sigma.jar)" {
  [API REST de eventos] as API
  [Vista / Panel de monitoreo] as VIS
  [Temporizador] as TMR
  [Controladores] as CTRL
  [Modelo de dominio] as MOD
  [Persistencia (DAO)] as DAO
}
database "MySQL 8\n(base sigma)" as DB
AG ..> BUF : sin conexión
MS ..> BUF
AG --> API : <<IEventos>>\nHTTPS/JSON
MS --> API : <<IEventos>>
API --> CTRL
VIS --> CTRL : <<IConsultas>>
TMR --> CTRL : verificarPuertasAbiertas()
CTRL --> MOD
CTRL --> DAO
DAO --> DB : <<JDBC>>
note right of API : En el prototipo del TP2 la API\nse simula con Main (argumentos)\ny la vista con VistaConsola.
@enduml
